  (text "RF: J1-J10 non-magnetic SMP (Amphenol RF SMP-MSLD-PCS-NM), DC-coupled 50-ohm GCPW to the die" (at 294.64 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 1ea29ce8-b273-44b2-a511-f4b8ec9b507a))
  (text "TRAP_A* vs TRAP_B* and ACC_A* vs ACC_B* length matched <= 0.20 mm (reports/length_report.txt)" (at 294.64 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 3bea4a4c-ca98-4698-bccd-c00115d15f9f))
  (text "H1-H4: M2.5 plated mounting holes to the Cu sample-holder base (GND)" (at 294.64 142.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid de27be8e-d6b7-4d30-98f0-e9877ff07618))
  (text "DESIGN NOTES" (at 17.78 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 335746a5-7635-40e8-8b74-2deb617db992))
  (text "1. Gate lines GATE_BS*: static gate voltages. 2-stage RC ladder R1 = R2 = 10 kOhm, C1 = C2 = 10 nF C0G: H(s) = 1/(1 + s(R1C1 + R2C2 + R1C2) + s^2 R1C1R2C2) -> f(-3 dB) = 596 Hz (limit <= 10 kHz)." (at 17.78 251.968 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 14493844-72a8-4f7e-b7cc-0ff53c23d973))
  (text "2. Load lines LOAD_*: flux ramp 0 -> Phi0 in ~1 us into a 1 nH load loop shorted on chip (current drive). Tee R1 = R2 = 1.0 kOhm, C = 18 pF: I/V = 1/(R1 + R2 + sC R1 R2) -> f(-3 dB) = 1/(2 pi C R1||R2) = 17.7 MHz (target 10-20 MHz);" (at 17.78 255.016 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5307d407-3375-424c-aa7c-95fc316548d8))
  (text "   into a high-impedance load 1/(2 pi R1 C) = 8.84 MHz. Both pass the 1 us ramp (bandwidth >= 5 MHz; tau = 9.0 ns)." (at 17.78 258.064 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid c157b9dd-efd7-471f-a03e-7d556d2298cf))
  (text "3. Parts for 10 mK: thin-film non-magnetic resistors (Vishay PNM), C0G/NP0 non-magnetic MLCC (Vishay VJ Non-Magnetic, Cu barrier), non-magnetic SMP. No ferrite, no X7R, no Ni-barrier terminations." (at 17.78 261.112 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 98ad66b8-d294-4bfd-a30c-c867dffaa9af))
  (text "4. RF lines are DC-coupled; the fast flux lines are shorted to ground on chip (current-driven). No on-board components on RF nets." (at 17.78 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid c3e31652-f797-49aa-9829-3d852ef3f1a3))
  (text "5. Net names = circuits/die_pads.json. Generated by pcb/build_carrier.py from pcb/carrier_params.py - edit the parameters, not this sheet." (at 17.78 267.208 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 73605807-4fab-4a8a-ab4a-0870cf481dc5))
